          "docs": "<p>Creates an X.509 certificate using the specified certificate signing request. </p> <p>Requires permission to access the <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/service-authorization/latest/reference/list_awsiot.html#awsiot-actions-as-permissions\">CreateCertificateFromCsr</a> action. </p> <note> <p>The CSR must include a public key that is either an RSA key with a length of at least 2048 bits or an ECC key from NIST P-25 or NIST P-384 curves. For supported certificates, consult <a href=\"https://d"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Amazon IoT Device Defender Describe Certificate",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "http://iot.{region}.amazonaws.com/certificates/:certificateId",
            "headers": [
