          "docs": "<p>Gets information about the specified certificate.</p> <p>Requires permission to access the <a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/service-authorization/latest/reference/list_awsiot.html#awsiot-actions-as-permissions\">DescribeCertificate</a> action.</p>"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Amazon IoT Device Defender Delete Certificate",
            "type": "http"
